#. SourceLocation:	/Script/UnrealPSKPSA.PsaImportSettings:bUseReferenceScale [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/UnrealPSKPSA.PsaImportSettings:bUseReferenceScale [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,PsaImportSettings:bUseReferenceScale"
msgid "Off by default. Ignore PSA animation scale and use each target mesh bone's reference scale, keeping position and rotation. Useful for unusually stretched animations; intentional scale effects are also ignored."
msgstr "Off by default. Ignore PSA animation scale and use each target mesh bone's reference scale, keeping position and rotation. Useful for unusually stretched animations; intentional scale effects are also ignored."

